@startuml
title inspect --detail Sequence
actor User
participant "CommandLineApplication" as CLI
participant "inspect_target(...)" as PublicAPI
participant "SecureWipeFacade" as Facade
participant "PathInspector" as Inspector
participant "DeviceCapabilityInspector" as CapabilityInspector
participant "ErasePathAdvisor" as Advisor

User -> CLI : securewipe inspect --detail <path>
CLI -> PublicAPI : inspect_target(path)
PublicAPI -> Facade : inspect(path)
Facade -> Inspector : inspect(path)
Inspector --> Facade : InspectionReport
Facade -> CapabilityInspector : inspect(DeviceInspectionContext)
CapabilityInspector --> Facade : DeviceCapabilities
Facade -> Advisor : advise(report)
Advisor --> Facade : ErasePathAdvice
Facade --> PublicAPI : InspectionReport + capabilities + advice
PublicAPI --> CLI : InspectionReport
CLI --> User : detailed report fields
@enduml